---
// Custom Hero component with Ralph Wiggum personality
---

<div class="hero-container">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-badge">
      <span class="badge-icon">↻</span>
      AI-Agnostic Agentic Loops
    </div>

    <h1 class="hero-title">
      <span class="title-main">ralph</span>
      <span class="title-accent">keeps going.</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-description">
      Reset the context. Feed the learnings. Watch it ship.
      <br />
      <span class="hero-subtext">
        A CLI tool for running AI coding agents for hours, not minutes.
      </span>
    </p>

    <div class="hero-terminal">
      <div class="terminal-header">
        <span class="terminal-dot red"></span>
        <span class="terminal-dot yellow"></span>
        <span class="terminal-dot green"></span>
        <span class="terminal-title">terminal</span>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal-body">
        <div class="terminal-line">
          <span class="terminal-prompt">$</span>
          <span class="terminal-command">ralph run</span>
          <span class="terminal-args">"Add tests for all auth modules"</span>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-output">
          <span class="output-icon">↻</span> Loop 1: Found 12 auth modules, added tests for UserAuth...
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-output">
          <span class="output-icon">↻</span> Loop 2: Added tests for SessionManager, TokenService...
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-output">
          <span class="output-icon">↻</span> Loop 3: Added tests for OAuth, SAML providers...
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-output success">
          <span class="output-icon">✓</span> Done. 47 test files created. All passing.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="/guides/quickstart/" class="btn-primary">
        Get Started
        <span class="btn-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/concepts/the-loop/" class="btn-secondary">
        How it works
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-quote">
      <blockquote>
        "Me fail English? That's unpossible!"
        <footer>— The philosophy: keep trying until it works</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-features">
    <div class="feature-item">
      <div class="feature-icon">🔄</div>
      <div class="feature-text">
        <strong>Context Reset</strong>
        <span>Fresh context window each iteration</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-item">
      <div class="feature-icon">🧠</div>
      <div class="feature-text">
        <strong>State Persistence</strong>
        <span>Learnings carry forward via git</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-item">
      <div class="feature-icon">🛑</div>
      <div class="feature-text">
        <strong>Exit Conditions</strong>
        <span>Smart stopping when done</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-item">
      <div class="feature-icon">🔧</div>
      <div class="feature-text">
        <strong>Tool Agnostic</strong>
        <span>Claude, OpenCode, any CLI</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .hero-container {
    max-width: 64rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem 4rem;
  }

  .hero-content {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 217, 61, 0.15) 0%, rgba(255, 159, 28, 0.15) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 217, 61, 0.3);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--sl-color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .badge-icon {
    font-size: 1rem;
    animation: spin 4s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes spin {
    from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 4.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .title-main {
    display: block;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sl-color-white) 0%, var(--sl-color-gray-2) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  :root:not([data-theme='dark']) .title-main {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sl-color-black) 0%, var(--sl-color-gray-4) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .title-accent {
    display: block;
    color: var(--sl-color-accent);
  }

  .hero-description {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    max-width: 32rem;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  :root:not([data-theme='dark']) .hero-description {
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-4);
  }

  .hero-subtext {
    font-size: 1rem;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .hero-terminal {
    background: #0D1117;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    text-align: left;
    box-shadow:
      0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1),
      0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06),
      0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .terminal-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    background: #161B22;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #30363D;
  }

  .terminal-dot {
    width: 0.75rem;
    height: 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .terminal-dot.red { background: #FF5F56; }
  .terminal-dot.yellow { background: #FFBD2E; }
  .terminal-dot.green { background: #27C93F; }

  .terminal-title {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #8B949E;
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
  }

  .terminal-body {
    padding: 1rem;
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .terminal-line {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .terminal-prompt {
    color: #7EE787;
  }

  .terminal-command {
    color: #79C0FF;
  }

  .terminal-args {
    color: #A5D6FF;
  }

  .terminal-output {
    color: #8B949E;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .terminal-output.success {
    color: #7EE787;
  }

  .output-icon {
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.875rem 1.75rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-accent);
    color: var(--sl-color-black);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(255, 217, 61, 0.4);
  }

  .btn-arrow {
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover .btn-arrow {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.875rem 1.75rem;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  :root:not([data-theme='dark']) .btn-secondary {
    color: var(--sl-color-black);
    border-color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    border-color: var(--sl-color-accent);
    background: rgba(255, 217, 61, 0.1);
  }

  .hero-quote {
    max-width: 28rem;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
  }

  .hero-quote blockquote {
    font-family: 'Comic Neue', cursive;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 217, 61, 0.08) 0%, transparent 100%);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--sl-color-accent);
    border-radius: 0 0.5rem 0.5rem 0;
  }

  :root:not([data-theme='dark']) .hero-quote blockquote {
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-4);
  }

  .hero-quote footer {
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .hero-features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .feature-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-bg-sidebar);
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline-light);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .feature-item:hover {
    border-color: var(--sl-color-accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .feature-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .feature-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .feature-text strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
  }

  :root:not([data-theme='dark']) .feature-text strong {
    color: var(--sl-color-black);
  }

  .feature-text span {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero-container {
      padding: 2rem 1rem 3rem;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .btn-primary,
    .btn-secondary {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 280px;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .hero-features {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
